<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia to start privatising cement industry.</title>
<headline>Tunisia to start privatising cement industry.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia said on Tuesday it would start privatising its cement industry over the next few months.</p>
<p>&quot;The first tender will be launched by April or May,&quot; Moncef Ben Abdallah, junior minister in charge of privatisation at the Economic Development Ministry, told journalists at a briefing.</p>
<p>&quot;Privatisation of three cement factories this year will be done by steps,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Tunisia has six state-owned cement factories. All of them are expected to be privatised.</p>
<p>Officials said the first tender would be for the sale of one of them. They would not say which one.</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
